### QuickBite API Tests
# Make sure the server is running on localhost:8080

### Get all restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/restaurants
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu for restaurant ID 1
GET http://localhost:8080/restaurants/1/menu
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurant_id": 1,
    "customer_name": "Ashuu Student",
    "total_amount": 15.98
}

###

### Get order details (Replace 1 with your actual order ID returned from the POST request)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update order status (Replace 1 with your actual order ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Preparing"
}
